### DriveShare — Módulo 3 Reservas (ReservationService)
### Base: http://localhost:3000/api/reservations
### Requiere: Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/reservations
@token = REEMPLAZAR_CON_JWT

### Crear reserva
POST {{baseUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": "VEH-001",
  "owner_id": "USR-002",
  "vehicle_name": "Toyota Corolla",
  "price_per_day": 120,
  "start_date": "2026-08-10",
  "end_date": "2026-08-14",
  "pickup_location": "Miraflores",
  "return_location": "Miraflores"
}

### Historial del arrendatario
GET {{baseUrl}}/user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Reservas del propietario
GET {{baseUrl}}/owner
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Disponibilidad
GET {{baseUrl}}/availability/VEH-001?start=2026-08-10&end=2026-08-14
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalle
GET {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Modificar fechas
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2026-08-11",
  "end_date": "2026-08-15",
  "pickup_location": "San Isidro",
  "return_location": "Miraflores"
}

### Confirmar (tras pago)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cancelar
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Aceptar (propietario)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Rechazar (propietario)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Cerrar / devolución
PUT {{baseUrl}}/1/close
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
